# Morrowind Temple: advancement. After the Seven Graces and Tuls Valen's and Tharer Rotheloth's first duties, the
# player asks Tharer Rotheloth for advancement once per rank ("Advancement": PCRaiseRank while the rank's reputation,
# attribute and skill needs are met), up to Curate (5), which Uvoo Llaren's, Endryn Llethan's and Tuls Valen's later
# duties need. Curate asks one favored skill at 50 and two at 15 (MorrowindRuntime's FACT table): SetRestoration,
# SetMysticism and SetAlchemy stand in for the player's training, and SetPersonality and SetIntelligence 31 (from
# 30) for level-up choices, since Curate also asks Personality and Intelligence of 31.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_mawia_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_advancement
run
player->SetRestoration 50
player->SetMysticism 15
player->SetAlchemy 15
player->SetPersonality 31
player->SetIntelligence 31
talk tharer rotheloth
ask Advancement
ask Advancement
ask Advancement
ask Advancement
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank Temple >= 5
bye
end
